  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#36f\"><strong>637 个新音效</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f60\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>该资源包采用我个人喜爱的写实简约风格，全面替换了《我的世界》的音效。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong> <span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0f0\">支持 1.10 至 26.X.X（最新版本）</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>想要环境音效？</strong> </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/enhanced-audio-ambience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">[点击此处] 增强音频：环境音</span></span></a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gAl1DKvs5-M\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>提示显示<span style=\"color:#f00\">不兼容</span>？</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><br></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/x5yK29l.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"403\" height=\"107\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>别担心，<span style=\"color:#0f0\">它仍然可以正常使用<span style=\"color:#000\">。</span></span></strong></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\">兼容性说明</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我已在旧版《我的世界》中测试过此资源包，它完全支持从 1.10 到最新版的各个版本。理论上也可用于更早的版本，但可能会出现明显的兼容性问题。</span></p>",
